{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_rift_scar_destroyed","model_identifier":"lair_rift_scar_destroyed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_rift_scar_destroyed\n\nlair_rift_scar_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_rift_scar.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -124.0..124.0, y 0.0..36.5, z -60.0..60.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- sealed scar: 220 x 42 x 90 centred on the origin (rock lips remain, crack filled)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- The crack has closed: filled with cooled grey rock, a dark seam down the middle, the pushed-up lips gone grey; no glow.\n"},"description":"# lair_rift_scar_destroyed\n\nlair_rift_scar_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_rift_scar.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -124.0..124.0, y 0.0..36.5, z -60.0..60.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- sealed scar: 220 x 42 x 90 centred on the origin (rock lips remain, crack filled)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- The crack has closed: filled with cooled grey rock, a dark seam down the middle, the pushed-up lips gone grey; no glow.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"scorched_ground","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_